---Surface property must have a positive [default value](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/SurfacePropertyPrototype.html%23default_value#default_value). When [SolarPanelEquipmentPrototype::solar\_coefficient\_property](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/SolarPanelEquipmentPrototype.html%23solar_coefficient_property#solar_coefficient_property) is set to point at a different surface property than "solar-power", then [LuaSurface::solar\_power\_multiplier](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/classes/LuaSurface.html#solar_power_multiplier) and [SpaceLocationPrototype::solar\_power\_in\_space](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/SpaceLocationPrototype.html%23solar_power_in_space#solar_power_in_space) will be ignored as the solar panel power output will be only affected by value of this surface property set on the surface using [PlanetPrototype::surface\_properties](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/PlanetPrototype.html%23surface_properties#surface_properties) or [LuaSurface::set\_property](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/classes/LuaSurface.html#set_property).
---
---Due to equipment grid overall description, when solar\_coefficient\_property is not solar-power, a different locale will be used to show total energy production of solar panels: `description.solar-panel-power-X` where X is the surface property name.
---
